Signature Development and Event Correlation
Objectives
By the end of this lab, students will be able to:

Create custom IDS signatures for Snort and Suricata
Configure Logstash pipelines for security event correlation
Implement pattern matching and anomaly detection rules
Build Kibana dashboards for security event visualization
Correlate multiple security events to identify attack patterns
Prerequisites
Basic understanding of network protocols (TCP/IP, HTTP, DNS)
Familiarity with Linux command line operations
Knowledge of regular expressions
Understanding of JSON data structures
Basic security concepts and IDS principles
