Troubleshooting Tips
Issue: Snort/Suricata not detecting events

Verify rules syntax with -T flag
Check network interface is correct
Ensure traffic is flowing through monitored interface
Review alert logs for errors
Issue: Logstash not processing events

Check file permissions on log files
Verify grok patterns match log format
Test configuration with -t flag
Review Logstash logs: /var/log/logstash/logstash-plain.log
Issue: Kibana visualizations empty

Verify index pattern matches Elasticsearch indices
Check time range in Kibana
Confirm data exists in Elasticsearch
Refresh field list in index pattern settings
Issue: Correlation not working

Verify correlation_key field is populated
Check aggregate filter timeout settings
Ensure events have matching correlation keys
Review Logstash debug output
Conclusion
This lab provided hands-on experience with signature development and event correlation using industry-standard tools. You created custom IDS signatures, built correlation pipelines, and visualized security events. These skills are essential for security operations centers (SOCs) and threat detection teams.

